{"ticker":{"symbol":"006090.KS","name":"사조오양","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":7800.0,"change_pct":0.01298701298701288,"market_cap":73497337856.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.01282051282051282,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":10530.0,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":null,"website":"https://oy.sajo.co.kr","business_summary":"Oyang Corporation engages in deep-sea fishing, food, and rental business in South Korea and internationally. The company offers crab sticks and frozen food; ham products, sausages, BBQ, bacons, topping food for pizzas, hot dogs, etc.; fish cakes; and dumplings. It also provides various fishes, including Pollack, cod, herring, halibut, snapper, squids, hoki, psenopsis anomala, red catfish, whiting, Japanese Spanish mackerel, bluefin tuna, big-eye tuna, yellowfin tuna, albacore tuna, marlin, skipjack tuna, and others. In addition, the company rents offices. Oyang Corporation was founded in 1969 and is based in Seoul, South Korea. Oyang Corporation is a subsidiary of Sajodaerim Corporation.","business_summary_ko":"오양기업은 국내외에서 원양어업, 식품, 렌탈 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 게살과 냉동 식품을 제공합니다. 햄 제품, 소시지, BBQ, 베이컨, 피자 토핑 식품, 핫도그 등; 어묵; 그리고 만두. 또한 명태, 대구, 청어, 광어, 도미, 오징어, 호키, 흑다랑어, 붉은 메기, 민어, 삼치, 참다랑어, 눈다랑어, 황다랑어, 날개다랑어, 청새치, 가다랑어 등 다양한 어종을 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 사무실을 임대합니다. 오양주식회사는 1969년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다. 오양산업은 사조대림산업의 자회사입니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"가공식품","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":369125207210.0,"operating_income":10201022830.0,"net_income":8526793520.0,"eps":905.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":391537751320.0,"operating_income":16282340430.0,"net_income":20298534630.0,"eps":2154.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":400696837980.0,"operating_income":20898559850.0,"net_income":1264